## File Structure
```
src/
  data/
    entities.json          # Entity schemas
    environments.json      # Environment-specific config
    schema-migrations.json # Database migrations
  contracts/
    app-contract.json      # App capabilities (auto-generated)
  components/
    {component-slug}/
      template.html        # Component template
      component.json       # Component metadata
heurisk.config.json        # Local config (do not commit)
```

## Component Template Conventions
- Templates are self-contained HTML with inline CSS/JS
- Use `window.heurisk` for platform APIs
- Data bindings: `{{field_name}}` syntax
- Event handlers: `data-on-click="handlerName"`
- Component state managed via `window.heurisk.setState()`

## GraphQL Schema
Query the GraphQL schema at `/api/graphql` for available types and mutations.
Common queries: `appManifest`, `appSecurityModel`, `entities`, `connectors`

## Environment Variables
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL` — Supabase project URL
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` — Anon key (client-side)
- `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` — Service role (server-side only)
- `GITHUB_TOKEN` — GitHub API token (for repo operations)
- `GITHUB_ORG` — GitHub organization/username

## Testing
- Unit tests: `npm test` (vitest)
- Type checking: `npm run test:typecheck` (tsc --noEmit)
- All tests must pass before committing
